name: ['Abzan Falconer', 'Aetherspouts', 'Ainok Bond-Kin', "Angel of Glory's Rise", 'Arcane Signet', 'Army of the Damned', "Avacyn's Memorial", "Avacyn's Pilgrim", 'Bastion Protector', 'Beast Within', 'Bestial Menace', 'Biogenic Upgrade', 'Blighted Woodland', 'Bojuka Bog', 'Butcher of Malakir', 'Canopy Vista', 'Celebrate the Harvest', 'Celestial Judgment', 'Cemetery Reaper', 'Champion of Lambholt', 'Charcoal Diamond', 'Choked Estuary', 'Citadel Siege', 'Cleansing Nova', 'Cleaver Skaab', 'Command Tower', "Commander's Sphere", 'Corpse Augur', 'Crowded Crypt', 'Curse of Clinging Webs', 'Curse of Conformity', 'Curse of Obsession', 'Curse of Unbinding', 'Curse of the Restless Dead', 'Custodi Soulbinders', 'Dark Salvation', 'Darkwater Catacombs', 'Dearly Departed', 'Death Baron', "Death's Presence", 'Dimir Aqueduct', 'Diregraf Captain', 'Diregraf Colossus', 'Distant Melody', 'Dread Summons', 'Dreadhorde Invasion', 'Drown in Dreams', 'Eater of Hope', 'Elite Scaleguard', 'Eloise, Nephalia Sleuth', 'Empty the Laboratory', 'Endless Ranks of the Dead', 'Enduring Scalelord', 'Eternal Skylord', 'Eternal Witness', 'Exotic Orchard', 'Feed the Swarm', 'Fleshbag Marauder', 'Forgotten Creation', 'Fortified Village', "Ghouls' Night Out", 'Gisa and Geralf', 'Gleaming Overseer', 'Go for the Throat', 'Gorex, the Tombshell', 'Gravespawn Sovereign', 'Growth Spasm', 'Gyre Sage', 'Havengul Runebinder', 'Herald of War', "Heron's Grace Champion", 'Heronblade Elite', 'Hordewing Skaab', 'Hour of Eternity', 'Hour of Reckoning', 'Inspiring Call', 'Juniper Order Ranger', 'Kessig Cagebreakers', 'Knight of the White Orchid', 'Krosan Verge', 'Kurbis, Harvest Celebrant', 'Kyler, Sigardian Emissary', 'Leinore, Autumn Sovereign', "Lifecrafter's Bestiary", "Liliana's Devotee", "Liliana's Mastery", "Liliana, Death's Majesty", 'Lord of the Accursed', 'Lynde, Cheerful Tormentor', 'Midnight Reaper', 'Mikaeus, the Lunarch', 'Moorland Rescuer', 'Mortuary Mire', 'Myriad Landscape', 'Odric, Master Tactician', 'Open the Graves', 'Orzhov Advokist', 'Overseer of the Damned', 'Path of Ancestry', 'Prowling Geistcatcher', 'Ravenous Rotbelly', 'Return to Dust', 'Riders of Gavony', "Rogue's Passage", 'Rooftop Storm', 'Ruinous Intrusion', 'Ruthless Deathfang', 'Selesnya Sanctuary', 'Shadow Kin', 'Shamanic Revelation', "Sigarda's Vanguard", "Sigarda, Heron's Grace", 'Sigardian Zealot', 'Sky Diamond', 'Sol Ring', 'Somberwald Beastmaster', 'Somberwald Sage', 'Spark Reaper', 'Stalwart Pathlighter', 'Stitcher Geralf', 'Sungrass Prairie', 'Sunken Hollow', 'Swiftfoot Boots', 'Swords to Plowshares', 'Syphon Flesh', 'Tainted Isle', 'Talisman of Dominance', 'Talisman of Unity', 'Temple of Deceit', 'Temple of Plenty', 'Temple of the False God', 'Tomb Tyrant', "Trostani's Summoner", 'Unbreakable Formation', 'Unclaimed Territory', 'Undead Alchemist', 'Undead Augur', 'Verdurous Gearhulk', "Victory's Envoy", 'Visions of Dominance', 'Visions of Dread', 'Visions of Duplicity', 'Visions of Glory', 'Visions of Ruin', 'Wall of Mourning', 'Wild Beastmaster', 'Wilhelt, the Rotcleaver', 'Yavimaya Elder', 'Zombie Apocalypse']
